  "releaseNotes": "17.6.2: Fixes Umbraco Deploy imports of evaluator configurations being silently rolled back: read-only database scopes now complete, so they no longer cancel the surrounding Deploy (or other) transaction. No changes in the step itself. 17.6.1: First release. Adds an \"Evaluate Page\" step to Umbraco Automate 17.5.1+: evaluates the latest saved version of a page with its active evaluator configuration and outputs the score, a pass/fail verdict (threshold and \"fail on any failed check\"), check counts, a summary and an email-ready HTML report in 10 languages.",
